config NSS_DRV_RMNET_ENABLE
	bool
	default n
	prompt "Enable RMNET"
	depends on TARGET_qualcommax_ipq807x || TARGET_qualcommax_ipq50xx
	select NSS_DRV_C2C_ENABLE
	help
	  Raw-IP WAN offload. The firmware carries the rmnet_rx nodes on
	  NSS core 1, so nss_rmnet_rx_create() points the host-to-NSS node
	  at the core-to-core transmit interface and C2C has to be built
	  for that nexthop to exist. Nothing binds on a board without a
	  raw-IP network device, and the allocation is answered by core 1
	  alone, so a device tree that leaves that core off binds nothing.

